# CFB warehouse leakage

Predicting game G may only use rows with `available_at` **strictly before kickoff**. If kickoff is missing: `available_at.date < game_date`, else `feature_week < game_week`. Unprovable timestamps are **not** available.

Forbidden as same-season features: final-season ratings, end-of-year SOS, post-hoc recruiting revisions, “what the freshman became”.

CFBD / cfbfastR / SportsDataverse are **ingest**. Download once to `/Volumes/KosEdgeData` (or gitignored `data/cfb/warehouse`). Season-engine / project-game must not live-query 20 years of history per request.

Odds: owned `odds_snapshots` lake is primary (open = first snap, close = last snap strictly before kickoff). SDV/CFBD betting is fill only. Join key `(game_date, home_name, away_name)`.

PBP: `raw/cfb/pbp/play_by_play_{year}.parquet` plus core EPA/success columns under `clean/cfb/historical/pbp/`. Not an opponent-adj mart.

Register new backtest features in `cfb_wh_feature_registry` and call `assert_available_before_kickoff`. No KEI from this warehouse.
